      "transcript": "ਗਉੜੀ ਪੂਰਬੀ₄"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00002",
      "start_time": 12.522,
      "end_time": 20.855,
      "transcript": "ਮਹਲਾ ਪੰਜਵਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00003",
      "start_time": 30.84,
      "end_time": 38.656,
      "transcript": "ਮੇਰੇ ਮਨ, ਸਰਣਿ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ ਸੁਖ ਪਾਏ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00004",
      "start_time": 38.656,
      "end_time": 46.215,
      "transcript": "ਜਾ ਦਿਨਿ ਬਿਸਰੈ ਪ੍ਰਾਨ ਸੁਖਦਾਤਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00005",
      "start_time": 46.365,
      "end_time": 54.845,
      "transcript": "ਸੋ ਦਿਨੁ ਜਾਤ ਅਜਾਏ ਰਹਾਉ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00006",
      "start_time": 62.96,
      "end_time": 71.197,
      "transcript": "ਏਕ ਰੈਣ ਕੇ ਪਾਹੁਨ ਤੁਮ ਆਏ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00007",
      "start_time": 71.197,
      "end_time": 79.215,
      "transcript": "ਬਹੁ ਜੁਗ ਆਸ ਬਧਾਏ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00008",
      "start_time": 79.64,
      "end_time": 87.572,
      "transcript": "ਗ੍ਰਿਹ ਮੰਦਰ ਸੰਪੈ ਜੋ ਦੀਸੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00009",
      "start_time": 87.572,
      "end_time": 95.335,
      "transcript": "ਜਿਉ ਤਰਵਰ ਕੀ ਛਾਏ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00010",
      "start_time": 95.68,
      "end_time": 103.55,
      "transcript": "ਤਨੁ ਮੇਰਾ ਸੰਪੈ ਸਭ ਮੇਰੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00011",
      "start_time": 103.55,
      "end_time": 111.285,
      "transcript": "ਬਾਗ ਮਿਲਖ ਸਭ ਜਾਏ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00012",
      "start_time": 111.775,
      "end_time": 119.92,
      "transcript": "ਦੇਵਨਹਾਰਾ ਬਿਸਰਿਓ ਠਾਕੁਰੁ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00013",
      "start_time": 119.92,
      "end_time": 127.595,
      "transcript": "ਖਿਨ ਮਹਿ ਹੋਤ ਪਰਾਏ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00014",
      "start_time": 127.8,
      "end_time": 135.567,
      "transcript": "ਪਹਿਰੈ ਬਾਗਾ ਕਰਿ ਇਸਨਾਨਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00015",
      "start_time": 135.567,
      "end_time": 143.235,
      "transcript": "ਚੋਆ ਚੰਦਨ ਲਾਏ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00016",
      "start_time": 143.68,
      "end_time": 151.356,
      "transcript": "ਨਿਰਭਉ ਨਿਰੰਕਾਰ ਨਹੀ ਚੀਨਿਆ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00017",
      "start_time": 151.356,
      "end_time": 159.375,
      "transcript": "ਜਿਉ ਹਸਤੀ ਨਾਵਾਏ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00018",
      "start_time": 159.56,
      "end_time": 167.299,
      "transcript": "ਜਉ ਹੋਇ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਲ ਤ ਸਤਿਗੁਰੁ ਮੇਲੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00019",
      "start_time": 167.299,
      "end_time": 174.785,
      "transcript": "ਸਭਿ ਸੁਖ ਹਰਿ ਕੇ ਨਾਏ"
